---
/**
 * AddStoryFlow (guest-submissions 4.1/D5)
 *
 * Full-screen, one-screen submission flow, laid out thumb-first for phones:
 * the picked-photo thumbnails, the picker row ("up to 3" | Choose photos |
 * "Remove all"), the single-line wish (≤30 chars), and the actions form one
 * bottom-anchored stack so every interactive element lands in finger reach.
 * Submitting is POST /api/submissions as multipart.
 *
 * Theme-aware (repo idiom: CSS vars with dark defaults + a
 * prefers-color-scheme: light override — WelcomeGate/index.astro precedent).
 *
 * Server-side validation remains the source of truth; the client pre-checks
 * only for fast feedback (invalid_body/invalid_wish_text/too_many_photos/
 * photo_too_large/invalid_photo_type map to inline field errors).
 */
---

<div
  id="add-story-flow"
  class="fixed inset-0 z-[10000] opacity-0 pointer-events-none bg-[color:var(--flow-bg)] text-[color:var(--flow-fg)]"
  aria-hidden="true"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-label="Share our stories"
>
  <div data-flow-panel class="relative h-full w-full overflow-y-auto">
    <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-full w-full max-w-md flex-col px-6 py-10">
      <h2 class="text-center text-lg font-medium">Share our stories</h2>

      <form data-flow-form class="mt-8 flex flex-1 flex-col" novalidate>
        <!-- Bottom-anchored stack: thumbnails → picker row → wish → actions.
        -->
        <div class="mt-auto space-y-4">
          {/* Picked photo previews: three 9:16 tiles fill the row; they sit
              directly above the picker row that manages them. */}
          <ul data-photo-list class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"></ul>

          {/* The native file input is visually hidden — its "no files
              selected." chrome is replaced by the label + preview list — but
              stays in the DOM and focusable for keyboard users. */}
          <input
            id="photo-input"
            type="file"
            accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif"
            multiple
            data-photo-input
            class="sr-only"
          />

          {/* Picker row: "up to 3" far left, Choose photos centered, "Remove
              all" far right — one line, aligned with the button. The
              1fr/auto/1fr grid keeps the label truly centered whether or not
              Remove all is shown; toggling `invisible` (not `hidden`) keeps
              the far-right cell occupied so the row never shifts. */}
          <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] items-center">
            <span class="justify-self-start text-xs text-[color:var(--flow-muted)]">up to 3</span>
            <label
              for="photo-input"
              class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center rounded-md border border-[color:var(--flow-border)] bg-[color:var(--flow-input-bg)] px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-[colors,transform] duration-160 ease-out hover:bg-[color:var(--flow-input-bg-hover)] active:scale-[0.98]"
            >
              Choose photos
            </label>
            <button
              type="button"
              data-photo-clear
              class="invisible justify-self-end text-xs text-[color:var(--flow-muted)] underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--flow-fg)] cursor-pointer"
            >
              Remove all
            </button>
          </div>

          <p data-photo-error class="hidden text-xs text-[color:var(--flow-error)]"></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Wish + actions: the wish input sits right above the buttons so it
             lands in thumb reach on phones. The char counter lives INSIDE the
             input, at its far right edge. -->
        <div class="space-y-6 pt-8">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="relative">
              <input
                id="wish-text"
                name="wishText"
                type="text"
                maxlength="30"
                data-wish-input
                aria-label="Wish"
                placeholder="Write a wish…"
                autocomplete="off"
                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[color:var(--flow-border)] bg-[color:var(--flow-input-bg)] py-2 pl-3 pr-14 text-sm outline-none placeholder:text-[color:var(--flow-placeholder)] focus:border-[color:var(--flow-border-focus)] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[color:var(--flow-border-focus)]"
              />
              <span
                data-wish-count
                class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 right-3 flex items-center text-xs text-[color:var(--flow-placeholder)]"
              >
                0 / 30
              </span>
            </div>
            <p data-wish-error class="hidden text-xs text-[color:var(--flow-error)]"></p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p data-flow-error class="mb-3 hidden text-xs text-[color:var(--flow-error)]"></p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6">
              <button
                type="button"
                data-flow-cancel
                class="rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-[color:var(--flow-muted)] transition-[colors,transform] duration-160 ease-out hover:bg-[color:var(--flow-ghost-hover)] hover:text-[color:var(--flow-fg)] active:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer"
              >
                Cancel
              </button>
              <button
                type="submit"
                data-flow-submit
                disabled
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[color:var(--flow-primary)] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-[color:var(--flow-primary-fg)] transition-[opacity,transform] duration-160 ease-out hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer"
              >
                <span data-flow-submit-label>Share</span>
                <svg
                  data-flow-spinner
                  class="hidden w-4 h-4 animate-spin"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <circle
                    cx="12"
                    cy="12"
                    r="10"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="3"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-dasharray="40 60"
                  />
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* Theme vars (repo idiom — WelcomeGate/index.astro precedent): dark by
     default, light override per device setting. Scoped to the flow root; the
     is:global escape hatch below only exists so dynamically-created preview
     tiles (built with DOM APIs in add-story-flow.ts, no Astro scope hash) can
     consume the same vars. */
  #add-story-flow {
    --flow-bg: #0a0a0a;               /* neutral-950 */
    --flow-fg: #fafafa;               /* neutral-50 */
    --flow-muted: #a3a3a3;            /* neutral-400 */
    --flow-placeholder: #525252;      /* neutral-600 */
    --flow-border: #404040;           /* neutral-700 */
    --flow-border-focus: #737373;     /* neutral-500 */
    --flow-input-bg: #171717;         /* neutral-900 */
    --flow-input-bg-hover: #262626;   /* neutral-800 */
    --flow-ghost-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    --flow-primary: #ffffff;
    --flow-primary-fg: #0a0a0a;       /* neutral-950 */
    --flow-error: #f87171;           /* red-400 — holds contrast on black */
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    #add-story-flow {
      --flow-bg: #ffffff;
      --flow-fg: #0a0a0a;            /* neutral-950 */
      --flow-muted: #525252;          /* neutral-600 */
      --flow-placeholder: #a3a3a3;   /* neutral-400 */
      --flow-border: #d4d4d4;        /* neutral-300 */
      --flow-border-focus: #737373;   /* neutral-500 */
      --flow-input-bg: #f5f5f5;       /* neutral-100 */
      --flow-input-bg-hover: #e5e5e5; /* neutral-200 */
      --flow-ghost-hover: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      --flow-primary: #0a0a0a;        /* neutral-950 */
      --flow-primary-fg: #ffffff;
      --flow-error: #b91c1c;         /* red-700 — holds contrast on white */
    }
  }

  /* Preview tiles are created at runtime with DOM APIs (no Astro scope
     attribute), so the selectors must be global; the var values themselves
     resolve from #add-story-flow above via inheritance. */
  :global(#add-story-flow [data-photo-list] li) {
    border-color: var(--flow-border);
    background-color: var(--flow-input-bg);
  }
</style>
